msgctxt "L_ELD_022"
msgid ""
"Joanna! It's Grimshaw. We've got hackers at \\nthe villa! You've got to stop"
" them\\n before they get to our files.\\n"
msgstr ""
"¡Joanna! Grimshaw al habla. ¡Tenemos 'hackers' en \\nla villa! Debes "
"detenerles antes de que accedan\\n a nuestros ficheros.\\n"

